<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδῑν-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whirl for</i> the throw, <i>swing round</i> before
			throwing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖψ᾽ ἐπιδινήσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.378
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.538
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i>turn over in one's mind, resolve</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόδε θυμὸς πόλλ᾽ ἐπιδινεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.218
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>wheel about</i>, as birds in the air, <i><span class="en">
				2.151
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σιληνοὶ . . ὄθμασι δινήθησαν ἔπι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδινεῖν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτούς</span>, of drones, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				624a24
			</span></i>.</div>
